# Shared-backbone multitask action-shield experiment (one output head per action).
# Submit from experiments/repair_wo_domain/submissions/action_shield/transport_linetrack
JOB COLLECT transport_linetrack_15_10_action_shield_collect.sub
JOB MERGE_COLLECTION transport_linetrack_15_10_action_shield_merge_collection.sub
JOB TRAIN transport_linetrack_15_10_action_shield_train.sub
JOB EVALUATE transport_linetrack_15_10_action_shield_evaluate.sub
JOB MERGE_EVALUATION transport_linetrack_15_10_action_shield_merge_evaluation.sub

PARENT COLLECT CHILD MERGE_COLLECTION
PARENT MERGE_COLLECTION CHILD TRAIN
PARENT TRAIN CHILD EVALUATE
PARENT EVALUATE CHILD MERGE_EVALUATION
